        <mxCell id="notes" value="• No VPC required - all fully managed AWS services&#xa;• Multi-tenant isolation: separate Kinesis streams + Snowflake databases&#xa;• X.509 certificate authentication for IoT devices (per gateway)&#xa;• IoT Policies with Topic ACLs enforce smdh/{tenant_id}/* pattern&#xa;• Cross-account IAM with External ID for Snowflake access&#xa;• IAM Role: iot-core-kinesis-role (Trust: IoT Core)&#xa;• IAM Role: smdh-snowflake-kinesis-role (Trust: Snowflake AWS Account + External ID)&#xa;• On-demand Kinesis, 24hr retention, partition by tenant_id&#xa;• Per-tenant CloudWatch Logs, Metrics, Alarms + SNS Topics&#xa;• Certificate lifecycle: 2-year validity, 30-day rotation reminders&#xa;• CloudTrail audit logging, KMS encryption for Kinesis&#xa;• Secrets Manager: External ID, certificates, credentials" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=11" parent="notes-box" vertex="1">
